Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_08170D02::
# 348 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "DESIERTO de entrenadores.\p“A pan duro, diente agudo”\p$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_08170D1E::
# 352 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string " pan duro, diente agudo”\p$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B0E3F::
# 356 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "This tree looks like it can be CUT down.\pWould you like to CUT it?$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B88D4::
# 360 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Enfréntate al ciberpoder de mi pokemon.\nEl soldado eléctrico$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B8911::
# 364 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "¡¡Mi ciberpokemon!!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B8925::
# 368 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Todo lo cíber mola\p…los cibercafés…\p…los cíberpokemon.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B895E::
# 372 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "After I lost to you, I learned a bunch\nof things about POKéMON.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B899E::
# 376 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I lost again?\nWhy couldn’t I win?$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B89C0::
# 380 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I’m fabulously wealthy, but I can’t\nseem to win at POKéMON...\pIt’s so deep, the world of POKéMON...$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B933A::
# 384 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "The sea is like my backyard.\nLet’s battle!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B9365::
# 388 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I lost on my home field...\nI’m in shock!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B938E::
# 392 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I swim the seas with a heart full of\ndreams...\pIt’s a song!\nAnyways, I’m swimming some more.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B93EB::
# 396 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Swimming in the big, wide sea, my\nPOKéMON has grown stronger!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B9429::
# 400 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "What a shock!\pMy POKéMON has gotten stronger, but\nI stayed weak as a TRAINER!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081B9477::
# 404 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "What you learn in battle makes you a\nstronger TRAINER.\lThe waves taught me that.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD49E::
# 408 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "ROSELIA es una rosa  \ny una rosa es una rosa, es una rosa.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD4D9::
# 412 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "…y sus espinas no respetan.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD4F9::
# 416 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "AMAR es el empiece de la palabra\nAMARGURA…\pNo intento deprimirte sino enseñarte\nque hasta las rosas más bonitas\lTienen espinas.\p¿Las espinas crecen con el tiempo? \n¡Compruébalo!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD569::
# 420 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Tienen espinas.\p¿Las espinas crecen con el tiempo? \n¡Compruébalo!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD5AB::
# 424 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "¡Que guay!\n¡Sabes un montón sobre  POKéMON!\p¡Con lo pequeñ{RIVAL} que eres…$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD5F2::
# 428 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Eres muy bueno \ncomo premio te voy a dar esta HM:\pObtuviste HM01.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD79A::
# 432 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I’m in the middle of a triathlon, but,\nwhatever, let’s have a battle!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD7E0::
# 436 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I ran out of energy!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD7F5::
# 440 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I may have blown it...\pI might have dropped to last during\nthat battle...$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD83F::
# 444 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I’m smack in the middle of a triathlon,\nbut I’m comfortably ahead.\lLet’s make this a quick battle!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD8A2::
# 448 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I ran out of energy again!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD8BD::
# 452 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I was tops in swimming and cycling, but\nI’m not quite that confident with\lPOKéMON yet.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD914::
# 456 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I do my triathlon training with POKéMON,\nso I’m pretty confident about my speed.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD965::
# 460 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I need to get more practices in,\nI guess.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD98F::
# 464 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Training is meaningful only if you\nkeep it up regularly.\pOkay! I’ll resume my training!\nTomorrow!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BD9F1::
# 468 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Are you keeping up with your training?\nI sure am!\lLet me show you the evidence!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDA41::
# 472 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I need to get more practices in,\nI guess.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDA6B::
# 476 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I’ll resume training tomorrow.\nLet’s battle again sometime!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDAA7::
# 480 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Aunque victorioso de piquito… \pMejor compruebo yo mismo:  \naquì medallas no cuentan.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDAFC::
# 484 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "¡Guau!\nVen cuando quieras pasar dentro.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDBC3::
# 488 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "ANNA: I’m with my pretty junior student\npartner. I have to do good!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDC07::
# 492 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "ANNA: I’m with my pretty junior student\npartner! Let me win!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDC44::
# 496 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "ANNA: Your POKéMON have some good\ncombinations.\pI’d say you’re second only to us!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDC96::
# 500 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "ANNA: If you want to battle us, bring\ntwo POKéMON with you.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDCD2::
# 504 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "MEG: I’m going to tag up with my super\nsenior student partner and beat you!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDD1E::
# 508 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "MEG: Oh, no!\nI’m sorry, ANNA! I let you down...$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDD4E::
# 512 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "MEG: I dragged ANNA down...\nIf I didn’t, she would have won!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDD8B::
# 516 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "MEG: Do you only have one POKéMON?\nWe can’t battle with you, then.\pWe want to have a 2-on-2 battle.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDDEF::
# 520 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "ANNA: I can’t keep losing in front of\nmy junior partner, right?$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDE2F::
# 524 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "ANNA: I couldn’t get into the groove.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDE55::
# 528 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "ANNA: Your POKéMON have some good\ncombinations.\pI’d say you’re second only to us!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDEA7::
# 532 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "ANNA: If you want to battle us, bring\ntwo POKéMON with you.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDEE3::
# 536 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "MEG: I’m going to tag up with my\nsenior partner and win this time!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDF26::
# 540 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "MEG: Too strong!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDF37::
# 544 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "MEG: I battled together with my\nsenior partner, but we lost...\pThat’s so discouraging...$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDF90::
# 548 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "MEG: Do you only have one POKéMON?\nWe can’t battle with you, then.\pWe want to have a 2-on-2 battle.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BDFF4::
# 552 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "The aroma of flowers has a magical\npower. It cleanses us body and soul.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BE03C::
# 556 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Oh, dear me.\nI seem to have lost.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BE05E::
# 560 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Flowers, POKéMON...\nI love whatever smells nice.\pStinky things...\nI’ll pass.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BE0AB::
# 564 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Were you drawn here by the sweet\naroma?$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BE0D3::
# 568 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "The power of aroma...\nIt didn’t seem to do much.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081BE104::
# 572 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "If you use a sweet aroma properly,\nPOKéMON will be attracted by it.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081C1C67::
# 576 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Isla MANDARINA   is still a long ways\naway...$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081C1C95::
# 580 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "My first victory seems to be far\naway, too...$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081C1CC3::
# 584 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "My whole life has been about losing,\nbut I will never give up!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081C1D02::
# 588 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I’m still feeling good. I’ll keep on\nswimming to EVER GRANDE CITY.$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081C1D45::
# 592 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I’ve yet to taste my first victory...$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_081C1D6B::
# 596 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "I’ll eventually reach EVER GRANDE CITY\nwhere I can eventually win...$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_086B8340::
# 600 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Tu medalla dice que eres grande.\p¡Mola que pase alguien \ntan buen{RIVAL} como tú!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_086B838D::
# 604 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "¿Necesitas ayuda\npara despejar la entrada?$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_086B83B8::
# 608 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "¡Bien hecho MACHOP!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_086B83CC::
# 612 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "¡Ahora ya puedes!$"

Naranja_MandarinDesert_Text_086BEF40::
# 616 "data/maps/Naranja_MandarinDesert/scripts.pory"
	.string "Podrías cortar este árbol…\p…pero va a ser que no.$"
